      "artist": "Chris Allen",
      "description": "Carew tide mill and mill house There is one spot where it is possible to get down by the water's edge and take this view. The mill house is unusually fine. The tide mill is a relatively unusual survivor and has two wheels (one very ruinous) and six sets of stones as well as a good range of auxiliary machine (grain cleaner, wire machine, etc).",
